        <briefdescription>
<para>Sends a single byte using the UART. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>It is blocking in that it waits for the transmitter to become non-full before it writes the byte to the transmit register.</para><para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">BaseAddress</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
